packages/main/src/core/process-fact-levels.ts-148-  { name: 'lifecycle_orchestrate', level: 'L0', category: 'readiness-read', owner: 'handlers/lifecycle-orchestrate', rationale: 'Read-only top-level lifecycle orchestration CAPSTONE (P8). COMPOSES the prior read-only layers (the V1 StoryReadinessReport plus P2-P7) into one consolidated, phase-aware view: it builds the V1 readiness report at the phase-appropriate target and composes ONLY the phase-relevant prior layers via their read-only default path (PLAN→plan_skeleton; verification intents present→evidence_plan + evidence_refresh DRY preview; REVIEW→reviewer_batch; TEST/approaching delivery→live_smoke_transcript STATUS + delivery_context_pack default), consolidates blockers + next actions from the V1 readiness rows (inventing no new readiness predicate), and emits the next-phase story_advance command as a PRINTED string (executed:false). It never passes a write/apply/capture/launch/run flag to a composed layer, never executes story_advance, runs no command, writes no evidence/metadata/artifact, launches no reviewer, advances no phase, and never claims release readiness.' },
